21:40.190 --> 21:42.150
<b>The 15-Year Lie</b>

21:42.920 --> 21:46.700
<i>Oh, boy. This is one hell of a story.</i>

21:49.630 --> 21:51.580
All it means is that Mom

21:51.580 --> 21:54.220
was a woman through and through.

21:55.080 --> 21:57.120
She was never able to be a mother.

21:57.750 --> 22:01.420
She loved men, and hated women.

21:59.460 --> 22:01.420
<b>The 15-Year Lie</b>

22:01.780 --> 22:06.760
Maybe that's why Mom 
hasn't come to pick me up.

22:07.260 --> 22:08.220
Not like that.

22:08.590 --> 22:11.220
Maybe that's why Mom hasn't come...

22:11.220 --> 22:13.310
Mom hasn't come...

22:13.740 --> 22:15.020
Mom!

22:15.530 --> 22:16.480
Mom...

22:16.480 --> 22:17.690
Mom?

22:19.000 --> 22:21.400
Mom... Mom!

22:22.060 --> 22:24.430
You're sweating buckets.

22:24.430 --> 22:25.620
Senpai.

22:26.030 --> 22:27.710
Are you getting any rest at all?

22:27.710 --> 22:31.580
You were already a hot commodity. 
Your schedule must be packed.

22:31.950 --> 22:33.310
It's okay.

22:33.310 --> 22:36.170
They've adjusted my schedule 
for the duration of the shoot.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.450
<i>Which means she has no 
time off at all right now.</i>

22:40.880 --> 22:48.600
<b>The 15-Year Lie</b>

22:41.430 --> 22:47.680
<i>I can't tell her not to push herself 
too hard after reading this script.</i>

22:48.600 --> 22:51.080
Maybe that's why Mom hasn't...

22:49.450 --> 22:52.990
<i>If I were Ruby, I wouldn't want 
anybody getting in the way.</i>

22:53.310 --> 22:54.690
Mom hasn't...

22:54.060 --> 22:57.770
<i>I'd want them to push me 
to my absolute limit.</i>

22:56.590 --> 22:57.770
Mom...

22:57.770 --> 23:01.850
Ruby. Rest your eyes when on the move, 
even if you have to force yourself.

23:01.850 --> 23:03.990
Even that makes a big difference.

23:04.520 --> 23:07.070
Just a word of advice from 
a former star child actor.

23:07.610 --> 23:10.830
Okay. Thanks, Senpai.

23:16.830 --> 23:19.840
<b>Ruby Hoshino</b>

23:16.830 --> 23:19.840
<b>Got it!
Thanks, Director</b>

23:16.830 --> 23:19.840
<b>Today</b>

23:16.830 --> 23:19.840
<b>Can I ask you
something, Director?</b>

23:16.830 --> 23:19.840
<b>It's the scene
about the mother...</b>

23:20.100 --> 23:21.420
Something the matter?

23:21.420 --> 23:22.650
Oh, nah.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.550
Kaburagi-san, Director Gotanda.

23:28.070 --> 23:30.870
Mind if I introduce you to someone?

23:30.870 --> 23:32.420
Sure, go ahead.

23:33.540 --> 23:34.680
This is...

23:34.680 --> 23:37.170
Tendouji-san from the advertising agency.
